# LaTeX intermediate / build artifacts
# (Based on the GitHub TeX.gitignore. PDFs are intentionally NOT ignored so
#  figures and the compiled output under pdf/ stay tracked.)

## Core latex/pdflatex auxiliary files
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.fmt
*.fot
*.cb
*.cb2
.*.lb

## Intermediate documents
*.dvi
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*

## Bibliography auxiliary files (bibtex/biblatex/biber)
*.bbl
*.bbl-SAVE-ERROR
*.bcf
*.blg
*-blx.aux
*-blx.bib
*.run.xml

## LaTeX Workshop (VSCode) live-build output dir — see .vscode/settings.json
build/

## pre-commit hook's own scratch build dir — see .githooks/pre-commit
.precommit-build/

## agent/CLI compile-check output dir(s) — see CLAUDE.md ("Building")
## (.build/ for the main paper; .build-<figid>/ for standalone per-figure checks)
.build*/

## Build tool auxiliary files
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex(busy)
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.pdfsync
latex.out/

## Beamer
*.nav
*.pre
*.snm
*.vrb

## Index / glossary / nomenclature
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.glg
*.glo
*.gls
*.glsdefs
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.lol
*.nlg
*.nlo
*.nls
*.brf

## Hyperref / xr / todonotes / etc.
*.xdy
*.tdo

## TikZ externalization
*.figlist
*.makefile
*.auxlock
*.dpth
*.md5

## minted / pygments
_minted*/
*.pyg
*.pytxcode
pythontex-files-*/

## Editor / OS cruft
*.bak
*.sav
*~
.DS_Store

## Uncomment to also ignore the compiled paper (if you prefer not to track it):
# paper-main.pdf
# pdf/*.pdf
